  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the pork belly.
  - Slice the green chilies.
  - Slice the bird's eye chilies.
  - Slice the garlic.
  - Slice the onion.
  - Slice the ginger.
  - Turn the stove to medium heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove.
  - Add the chopped pork belly.
  - Add the shrimp paste.
  - "Saut\xE9 and render the fat."
  - Add the garlic.
  - Add the onion.
  - Add the ginger.
  - "Saut\xE9 until brown."
  - Pour in the water.
  - Pour in the coconut milk.
  - Stir the wok.
  - Add the green chilies.
  - "Add the bird\u2019s eye chilies."
  - Add the coconut cream.
  - Add 1 tsp of fish sauce.
  - Add 1 tsp of sugar.
  - Mix using the spatula.
  - Add 1 tbsp of pepper.
  - Put the lid on the wok to simmer.
